    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Ao\u00fbt 1715. \u00c0 son retour de promenade, Louis XIV ressent une vive douleur \u00e0 la jambe. Les jours suivants, le Roi poursuit ses obligations mais ses nuits sont agit\u00e9es, la fi\u00e8vre le gagne. Il se nourrit peu et s\u2019affaiblit de plus en plus. C\u2019est le d\u00e9but de la lente agonie du plus grand Roi de France, entour\u00e9 de ses fid\u00e8les et de ses m\u00e9decins.",
        "english": "August 1715. After going for a walk, Louis XIV feels a pain in his leg. The next days, the King keeps fulfilling his duties and obligations, but his sleep is troubled and he has a serious fever. He barely eats and weakens increasingly. This is the start of the slow agony of the greatest King of France, surrounded by his relatives and doctors."
    },
